{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>About This Game:</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Do you love ramen? Do you want to make your own ramen?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3574020/extras/debfde8bddb0f6aa836429e83de5cc74.poster.avif?t=1771921834\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3574020/extras/debfde8bddb0f6aa836429e83de5cc74.webm?t=1771921834\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3574020/extras/debfde8bddb0f6aa836429e83de5cc74.mp4?t=1771921834\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This game will make your dream come true; you will be fascinated and immerse yourself in the world of ramen. From selecting ingredients to make the soup, the type of noodle, sauce, and aroma oil, to a variety of toppings.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It's a ramen universe.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3574020/extras/8122035264180815f5ae1babce12fc7f.poster.avif?t=1771921834\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3574020/extras/8122035264180815f5ae1babce12fc7f.webm?t=1771921834\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3574020/extras/8122035264180815f5ae1babce12fc7f.mp4?t=1771921834\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Features:</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udf5c <strong>Free Mode:</strong> Unleash your creativity! Mix and match flavors your way.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83e\udd62 <strong>100+ Toppings:</strong> From classic Chashu to quirky treats the possibilities are endless.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udfaf <strong>More More Mode:</strong> How high can you stack? Challenge yourself to build the tallest ramen ever!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udf06 <strong>Mini-Games:</strong> Take a break with fun, ramen themed challenges.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udc68\u200d\ud83c\udf73 <strong>Snap &amp; Save:</strong> Proud of your creation? Save your delicious masterpieces to your gallery.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udf5c <strong>Slurp It Up:</strong> Don't just cook it, enjoy your own custom made ramen!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udcd6 <strong>Shop &amp; Quests:</strong> Complete daily missions to unlock exclusive ingredients and shop items.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3574020?t=1771921834","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3574020?t=1771921834","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3574020/1127e7255fdcb301e9754429b70714fd5de21cde/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1771921834","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3574020/1127e7255fdcb301e9754429b70714fd5de21cde/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1771921834","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Partial Controller Support","id":18},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"demos":[{"appid":4382600,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>About This Game:</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Do you love ramen? Do you want to make your own ramen?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3574020/extras/debfde8bddb0f6aa836429e83de5cc74.poster.avif?t=1771921834\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3574020/extras/debfde8bddb0f6aa836429e83de5cc74.webm?t=1771921834\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3574020/extras/debfde8bddb0f6aa836429e83de5cc74.mp4?t=1771921834\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This game will make your dream come true; you will be fascinated and immerse yourself in the world of ramen. From selecting ingredients to make the soup, the type of noodle, sauce, and aroma oil, to a variety of toppings.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It's a ramen universe.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3574020/extras/8122035264180815f5ae1babce12fc7f.poster.avif?t=1771921834\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3574020/extras/8122035264180815f5ae1babce12fc7f.webm?t=1771921834\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3574020/extras/8122035264180815f5ae1babce12fc7f.mp4?t=1771921834\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Features:</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udf5c <strong>Free Mode:</strong> Unleash your creativity! Mix and match flavors your way.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83e\udd62 <strong>100+ Toppings:</strong> From classic Chashu to quirky treats the possibilities are endless.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udfaf <strong>More More Mode:</strong> How high can you stack? Challenge yourself to build the tallest ramen ever!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udf06 <strong>Mini-Games:</strong> Take a break with fun, ramen themed challenges.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udc68\u200d\ud83c\udf73 <strong>Snap &amp; Save:</strong> Proud of your creation? Save your delicious masterpieces to your gallery.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udf5c <strong>Slurp It Up:</strong> Don't just cook it, enjoy your own custom made ramen!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udcd6 <strong>Shop &amp; Quests:</strong> Complete daily missions to unlock exclusive ingredients and shop items.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","developers":["SECRET CHARACTER","HaconN"],"genres":[{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Simulation","id":"28"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3574020/be030fe00846d8f0f6a9b4e189b81780233fd807/header.jpg?t=1771921834","is_free":false,"legal_notice":"\u00a9 SECRET CHARACTER \u00a9 Flyhigh Works","linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3574020/1986023094/baa97297a2c8c96d7c1227f59ea93d5d0bcd0c30/1771409716/dash_av1.mpd?t=1771903896","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3574020/1986023094/baa97297a2c8c96d7c1227f59ea93d5d0bcd0c30/1771409716/dash_h264.mpd?t=1771903896","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3574020/1986023094/baa97297a2c8c96d7c1227f59ea93d5d0bcd0c30/1771409716/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1771903896","id":257289253,"name":"Demo Out Now","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257289253/e3f70fc67b754fbd9e4612ec049df757d1aa28f0/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1771903896"},{"dash_av1":"https://vi